# Go build artifacts: build them yourself, never commit them
/zot-kanban
/zot-kanban.exe
*.test

# Scratch a zot session leaves when this clone is opened as a project, and the project-local copy
# placed under ./.zot/extensions
/.zot-tmp
/.zot/extensions/

# The board's own state, when a board is served from this clone. It is not part of the artifact, and
# it must not stand in the way of publishing one: untracked files here would be read as an
# unpublished local edit.
.kanban/
